Output stickers.gif

Set Height 600
Set Width 1000

Hide
	Type "go build -o program ." Enter
	Type "clear && ./program" Enter
	Sleep 1s
Show

Tab
Sleep 2s

Type "Starmi"
Sleep 1s
Tab

Right@1s  5
Sleep 2s
Type "/can"
Sleep 2s
Tab

Type "21 Charm St."
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+j
Type "Vancouver, BC"
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+j
Type "A1A 1A1"
Sleep 2s
Tab

Tab
Enter
Sleep 2s


Hide
Type "rm program" Enter
Sleep 1s
	
